OL,3,GNEWSAFortnightly bin rounds could start
OL,4,Ain city within months
OL,5,
OL,6,FFortnightly bin collections could be
OL,7,Fintroduced across Birmingham within
OL,8,Fmonths after a successful trial.
OL,10,FA pilot scheme in parts of the city
OL,11,Freplaced weekly rubbish collections
OL,12,Fwith fortnightly ones, alongside weekly
OL,13,Ffood waste pickups and a second
OL,14,Frecycling bin.
OL,16,FA Birmingham City Council report said
OL,17,Fthe trial, in north Birmingham and
OL,18,FSutton Coldfield, saw better recycling
OL,19,Frates and would save #14m a year
OL,20,Fcompared to retaining weekly
OL,21,Fcollections.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
