OL,3,GNEWSAFortnightly bin rounds could start
OL,4,Ain city within months
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn earlier version of the council
OL,7,Freport said fortnightly collections
OL,8,Fwould return in February, however the
OL,9,Fauthority confirmed no decision had
OL,10,Fbeen made.
